        "start_time.descr": "The metadata recording start time from the beginning of the video. The input format is d.hh:mm:ss, and the default start time is 0.00:00:00. Metadata time stamps are not used in this field; the time of the video file is used.",
        "start_time.title": "Metadata Capture Start Time",
